    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“真糊塗，一切要用科學方法來解釋，你覺得這夢是一種心理，心理是從哪裏來的？",
      "output_sha256": "32b7e7024e9deeb9abe2cc2febc45b56aa725216e2fb12a238e01acac61efe71",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
